  "solution": "The pattern followed in the given series is:\n\n**(First term ****× (Third term - 1)) - (Third term - 1) = Second term**\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given sets:\n\n(23, 308, 15)\n\n(23 × (__**15 - 1**__)) - (__**15 - 1**__) = 308\n\n(__**23**____** **____**× 14**__) - 14 = 308\n\n__**322 - 14**__ = 308\n\n308 = 308\n\n(18, 187, 12)\n\n(18 × (__12 - 1__)) - (__12 - 1__) = 187\n\n(__**18**____ ____× 11__) - 11 = 187\n\n__198 - 11__ = 187\n\n187 = 187\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given options:\n\nOption 1) (14, 104, 9)\n\n(14 × (__**9**____ - 1__)) - (__9 - 1__) = 104\n\n(__14____ ____× 8__) - 8 = 104\n\n__112 - 8__ = 104\n\n104 = 104\n\nOption 2) (19, 325, 27)\n\n(19 × (__27 - 1__)) - (__**27** - 1__) = 325\n\n(__19____ ____× 26__) - 26 = 325\n\n__494 - 26__ = 325\n\n468 ≠ 325\n\nOption 3) (20, 280, 14)\n\n(20 × (__14 - 1__)) - (__14 - 1__) = 280\n\n(__20____ ____× 13__) - 13 = 280\n\n__260 - 13__ = 280\n\n247 ≠ 280\n\nOption 4) (16, 122, 7)\n\n(16 × (__7 - 1__)) - (__7 - 1__) = 122\n\n(__**16**____ ____× 6__) - 6 = 122\n\n__96 - 6__ = 122\n\n90 ≠ 122\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 1)**",
